# Never uploaded to Vercel. The raw archive and local tooling stay local;
# only the frontend build inputs and backend/src (for the API function) deploy.
# pyproject.toml/uv.lock are the LOCAL uv workspace (root package has no deps) —
# they must not shadow requirements.txt, which drives the function's installs.
pyproject.toml
uv.lock
data/
.venv/
node_modules/
ingest/
pipeline/
db/
scripts/
docs/
frontend/smoke-artifacts/
frontend/scripts/
*.log
.env
